A vicious finishing strike that deals [200%, 233%, 259%, 280%, 300% (TL1-5)] damage increased by 20% per combo point you have up to a max of [400%, 467%, 518%, 561%, 600% (TL1-5)]. If the target ends up with low enough life (<20%), it might be instantly killed.

Killing a target with Haymaker will instantly restore [4%, 7%, 9%, 11%, 13% (TL1-5)] to [14%, 16%, 17%, 18%, 20% (TL1-5)] of your maximum stamina, depending on the amount of combo points you've accumulated.

Using this talent removes your combo points.
